|term[containment-coordinate] :status settled :defined-by def-locations-and-paths :anchor identity-vs-location
  :word containment-coordinate
  :synonyms [coordinate]
  The name of one nesting container inside a [[term/location]] chain.
  |invariants
    - Is a kind of [[term/designator]]
    - Belongs to [[term/location]]
    - Containers it names nest, which is what lets locations route
